usage: frontend_compare_frozen_tests.py [-h] --against REFERENCE
                                        --source SOURCE
                                        [--corpus-source CORPUS_SOURCE]
                                        [--compiler-sha256 COMPILER_SHA256]
                                        [--source-commit SOURCE_COMMIT]
                                        [--against-identity-sha256 AGAINST_IDENTITY_SHA256]
                                        [--normalize-source-paths]
                                        --compiler COMPILER --output OUTPUT
                                        --cache CACHE [--jobs JOBS]
                                        [--expected-tests EXPECTED_TESTS]

Compare exact frozen per-file, directory and configured tests without oracle
runs. Run with an outer bench-compile.lock, then scripts/build-slot.sh.
Examples: --source CANDIDATE_WORKTREE --compiler BINARY --against
FROZEN_REF_DIR --output FRESH_RESULTS --cache OWNED_CACHE [--corpus-source
MIGRATED_WORKTREE] Only compiler/cache arguments change in the saved commands.
Relocating a corpus requires --normalize-source-paths: recorded changes are
confined to JSON sources and at fields plus diagnostic source filenames;
line/column/verdict bytes remain. All modes, force, leak checking, jobs,
timeouts and budgets come from the references.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --against, --reference REFERENCE
  --source SOURCE       candidate compiler source worktree
  --corpus-source CORPUS_SOURCE
                        candidate corpus worktree; default frozen external
                        source or --source for internal tests
  --compiler-sha256 COMPILER_SHA256
                        optional independently recorded candidate binary hash
  --source-commit SOURCE_COMMIT
                        optional independently recorded candidate source HEAD
  --against-identity-sha256 AGAINST_IDENTITY_SHA256
                        optional independently recorded frozen identity hash
  --normalize-source-paths
                        audit exact source-path relocation; preserve every
                        other field/byte
  --compiler COMPILER
  --output OUTPUT
  --cache CACHE
  --jobs JOBS           file workers; default frozen collector count
  --expected-tests EXPECTED_TESTS
                        optional frozen unique test count assertion
